note OM-1 TWIN of ce-sized-oob.om (unroll removed, om2 line made a note) for the pinned compiler 734f0a39.
note Contract section 4 lines 105-106: after unrolling, get a4 i with i = 4 is a constant index outside
note the 4-element SIZED array a4: error 21 at compile time (line 10, the get). Without unroll
note (ce-sized-oob-rolled.om) the index is a run-time value and OM-1 traps 3 at run time instead.
note OM-1 unit: this line replaces the om2 line
fn main to int
a4 = new ulong 4 7
s = ulong 0
for i ulong 5
s = add s get a4 i
end
ret int s
end
